WEBVTT

00:07.455 --> 00:08.767
- Are you ready, kids?
- 孩子们，你们准备好了吗？

00:08.836 --> 00:10.424
Kids:
Aye, aye, Captain!
孩子们：
是啊是啊，队长！

00:10.493 --> 00:11.942
- I can't hear you.
- 我听不到你说话。

00:12.012 --> 00:14.048
Kids:
Aye, aye, Captain!
孩子们：
是啊是啊，队长！

00:14.117 --> 00:17.017
- ♪ Ohh... ♪
- ♪ 哦...♪

00:17.086 --> 00:19.053
♪ Who lives in a pineapple
under the sea? ♪
♪ 谁住在菠萝里
在海底？ ♪

00:19.122 --> 00:21.124
Kids:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
孩子们：
海绵宝宝！

00:21.193 --> 00:22.953
- ♪ Absorbent and yellow
and porous is he ♪
- ♪ 吸水性和黄色
他是多孔的 ♪

00:23.023 --> 00:24.921
kids:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
孩子们：
海绵宝宝！

00:24.990 --> 00:27.096
- ♪ If nautical nonsense
be something you wish ♪
- ♪ 如果航海废话
成为你想要的东西♪

00:27.165 --> 00:29.167
kids:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
孩子们：
海绵宝宝！

00:29.236 --> 00:31.065
- ♪ Then drop on the deck
and flop like a fish ♪
- ♪ 然后落在甲板上
然后像鱼一样扑通扑通♪

00:31.134 --> 00:33.067
kids: SpongeBob SquarePants!
- Ready?
孩子们：海绵宝宝！
- 准备好？

00:33.136 --> 00:34.862
All:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:34.931 --> 00:37.209
SpongeBob SquarePants!
海绵宝宝！

00:37.278 --> 00:39.142
SpongeBob SquarePants!
海绵宝宝！

00:39.211 --> 00:40.419
- SpongeBob
- 海绵宝宝

00:40.488 --> 00:42.318
SquarePants!
方裤！

00:42.387 --> 00:45.079
[laughing]
[笑]

00:45.148 --> 00:47.323
[flute plays]
[长笛演奏]

00:47.392 --> 00:48.772
[waves crashing]
[海浪拍打]

00:50.153 --> 00:53.018
[exciting music]
[激动人心的音乐]

00:53.087 --> 00:59.990
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

01:01.406 --> 01:03.408
- [humming]
- [嗡嗡声]

01:03.477 --> 01:04.409
[gasps]
[喘气]

01:04.478 --> 01:05.789
Look, Patrick!
看，帕特里克！

01:05.858 --> 01:08.137
Dirty Bubble trading cards!
肮脏的泡泡集换卡！

01:08.206 --> 01:11.312
The rarest trading cards
in existence!
最稀有的集换式卡牌
存在！

01:11.381 --> 01:13.211
[chuckling]
[轻笑]

01:13.280 --> 01:16.593
- Ooh, I invoke the
ancient rite of dibs!
- 哦，我调用了
古老的权利仪式！

01:16.662 --> 01:17.732
- [yells]
- [大喊]

01:17.801 --> 01:20.908
- Can't argue with that!
- 无法反驳这一点！

01:20.977 --> 01:24.705
- Yes, my collection
of Dirty Bubblobilia
- 是的，我的收藏
肮脏的泡泡菌

01:24.774 --> 01:27.397
will finally be complete.
最终将完成。

01:27.466 --> 01:28.812
- Congratulations.
- 恭喜。

01:28.881 --> 01:31.539
You're the coolest guy here.
你是这里最酷的人。

01:31.608 --> 01:34.197
- [grunts]
- [咕哝]

01:36.406 --> 01:38.753
- [sniffs] Ah.
- [抽鼻子] 啊。

01:38.822 --> 01:42.067
There's nothing like
the smell of vintage dust.
没有什么比
复古灰尘的味道。

01:42.136 --> 01:43.965
- Bubble Bass!
- 泡泡鲈鱼！

01:44.034 --> 01:47.176
Have you been in that
musty comic shop again?
你有没有去过那个地方
漫画店又发霉了？

01:47.245 --> 01:51.456
You march yourself upstairs
and take your bath!
你大步上楼
洗澡吧！

01:51.525 --> 01:55.598
- While we're here,
why not make the most of it?
- 当我们还在这里的时候，
为什么不充分利用它呢？

01:55.667 --> 01:59.326
A little official
Dirty Bubble bubble bath.
有点官方
脏泡泡浴。

01:59.395 --> 02:02.881
Now, where are those cards?
现在，那些卡在哪里？

02:02.950 --> 02:05.401
Ooh, hoo, hoo,
they come with a stick
噢，呼，呼，
他们带着一根棍子来

02:05.470 --> 02:08.300
of Dirty Bubble bubble gum.
脏泡泡糖。

02:08.369 --> 02:10.233
- [evil laugh]
- [邪恶的笑声]

02:12.649 --> 02:16.170
[hard crunching]
[艰难的咀嚼]

02:16.239 --> 02:20.140
- [coughing]
- [咳嗽]

02:20.209 --> 02:21.451
Eh.
呃。

02:21.520 --> 02:23.729
Oh, dear, the nostalgic flavor
噢，亲爱的，怀旧的味道

02:23.798 --> 02:27.423
has given me a case
of dyspepsia.
给了我一个案例
消化不良。

02:27.492 --> 02:29.770
[bubbling]
[冒泡]

02:29.839 --> 02:32.255
- [evil laugh]
- [邪恶的笑声]

02:32.324 --> 02:33.394
- [gasps]
- [喘气]

02:33.463 --> 02:34.395
- Yes!
- 是的！

02:34.464 --> 02:35.569
I'm free!
我自由了！

02:35.638 --> 02:37.226
- The Dirty Bubble!
- 肮脏的泡泡！

02:37.295 --> 02:40.677
- You chewing that crusty gum
has freed me from
- 你嚼着硬皮口香糖
让我摆脱了

02:40.746 --> 02:42.990
Mermaid Man's bubblegum trap.
美人鱼人的泡泡糖陷阱。

02:43.059 --> 02:45.682
What's your name,
my bulbous buddy?
你叫什么名字，
我的球根朋友？

02:45.751 --> 02:48.133
- Buh-buh... Bubble Bass.
- 嗯嗯...泡泡鲈鱼。

02:48.202 --> 02:51.550
- What a perfect name
for my new sidekick.
- 多么完美的名字
为了我的新伙伴。

02:51.619 --> 02:54.277
Or should I say, inside kick.
或者我应该说，内踢。

02:54.346 --> 02:56.486
- [yells]
- [大喊]

02:56.555 --> 02:58.419
Let me out!
放我出去吧！

02:58.488 --> 03:01.560
- [evil laugh]
- [邪恶的笑声]

03:01.629 --> 03:06.427
As a reward for releasing me,
you're my new partner in crime.
作为释放我的奖励，
你是我的新犯罪伙伴。

03:06.496 --> 03:08.567
- What's going on in...
- 发生了什么事...

03:08.636 --> 03:10.155
Bubble Bass!
泡泡贝斯！

03:10.224 --> 03:12.399
You're even filthier than
before you took a bath.
你比你还脏
在你洗澡之前。

03:12.468 --> 03:14.573
- It's not my fault, Mother.
- 这不是我的错，妈妈。

03:14.642 --> 03:18.267
I'm trapped inside
this foul felon.
我被困在里面
这个肮脏的重罪犯。

03:18.336 --> 03:21.787
- I hate to come between
a man child and his mama,
- 我讨厌介于两者之间
一个男孩和他的妈妈，

03:21.856 --> 03:24.134
but it's time to grime.
但现在是时候去污垢了。

03:24.204 --> 03:25.446
[evil laugh]
[邪恶的笑声]

03:25.515 --> 03:27.379
- [screams]
- [尖叫]

03:27.448 --> 03:29.001
- Filthy!
- 肮脏的！

03:29.070 --> 03:32.764
- Ugh, it'll take forever
to get out of this goop.
- 呃，这将需要永远
摆脱这个困境。

03:32.833 --> 03:35.560
- I'm sorry, Mother!
- 对不起，妈妈！

03:35.629 --> 03:38.425
- [evil laugh]
- [邪恶的笑声]

03:38.494 --> 03:41.082
OK, let's get busy now.
好吧，我们现在开始忙吧。

03:41.151 --> 03:42.463
- Please!
- 请！

03:42.532 --> 03:45.259
Remove yourself from my person!
把你自己从我身边移开！

03:45.328 --> 03:48.400
- Sorry, fella, but you'll
be the perfect cover
- 抱歉，伙计，但你会的
成为完美的封面

03:48.469 --> 03:49.781
for my crimes.
为了我的罪行。

03:49.850 --> 03:51.576
And don't get any funny ideas.
并且不要有任何有趣的想法。

03:51.645 --> 03:55.235
The Dirty Bubble
is in control now.
肮脏的泡沫
现在已得到控制。

03:55.304 --> 03:56.581
- Physical activity?
- 体力活动？

03:56.650 --> 03:58.203
No!
不！

03:58.272 --> 04:00.378
Anything but that!
除了那个之外什么都可以！

04:00.447 --> 04:02.414
[tires squealing]
[轮胎吱吱声]

04:02.483 --> 04:05.348
Please, do something!
拜托，做点什么吧！

04:05.417 --> 04:09.110
[squeals]
Whew.
[尖叫声]
呼。

04:09.179 --> 04:11.527
Hm?
嗯？

04:11.596 --> 04:13.460
[bell dings]
[铃声]

04:17.464 --> 04:19.259
[panting]
[气喘吁吁]

04:19.328 --> 04:24.816
- Now that you know who's boss,
let's start our grime spree.
- 现在你知道谁是老大了
让我们开始我们的污垢狂欢吧。

04:25.955 --> 04:28.268
I haven't bagged a bank in ages.
我已经好久没抢过银行了。

04:28.337 --> 04:29.545
- Eh.
- 呃。

04:29.614 --> 04:31.409
- Nobody move!
- 没人动！

04:31.478 --> 04:32.996
This is a stink up!
这真是臭气熏天啊！

04:35.033 --> 04:36.759
- Ew!
- Ah!
- 呃！
- 啊！

04:36.828 --> 04:37.967
Disgusting.
恶心。

04:38.036 --> 04:41.281
[alarm ringing, screaming]
[警报响起，尖叫]

04:42.937 --> 04:45.285
- We may need to do a little...
- 我们可能需要做一点...

04:45.354 --> 04:47.666
money laundering.
洗钱。

04:47.735 --> 04:50.255
- I guess crime does pay.
- 我想犯罪是有代价的。

04:50.324 --> 04:53.500
[sirens wail]
[警报声]

04:53.569 --> 04:55.191
- Freeze, you filthy felon!
- 别动，你这个肮脏的重罪犯！

04:55.260 --> 04:58.677
- Thanks for the compliment,
Officer.
- 谢谢你的夸奖，
军官。

04:58.746 --> 05:00.783
- [yells]
- [大喊]

05:00.852 --> 05:03.303
No!
不！

05:03.372 --> 05:05.132
- Mucked!
- 搞砸了！

05:05.201 --> 05:08.998
- I'm beginning to enjoy
this little felonious...
- 我开始享受
这个小重罪……

05:09.067 --> 05:12.726
[panting]
excursion.
[气喘吁吁]
游览。

05:12.795 --> 05:14.659
[stomach growling]
[肚子咕咕叫]

05:14.728 --> 05:17.869
I need sustenance, though.
但我需要食物。

05:17.938 --> 05:21.528
I know the perfect crime
to fill our bellies.
我知道完美的犯罪
来填饱我们的肚子。

05:21.597 --> 05:23.599
- I like your moxie.
- 我喜欢你的勇气。

05:23.668 --> 05:25.877
Show me what you got, Sidekick.
告诉我你有什么，Sidekick。

05:29.087 --> 05:32.953
- Give me all your
Krabby Patties post haste.
- 给我你的一切
甲蟹肉饼匆忙后。

05:33.022 --> 05:35.576
- Keep your shirt on...
- 穿上你的衬衫...

05:35.645 --> 05:37.371
eh, goop on.
呃，继续。

05:37.440 --> 05:39.891
- All our Krabby Patties?
- 我们所有的蟹黄肉饼？

05:39.960 --> 05:42.928
I'll handle this charming
customer, Mr. Squidward.
我会处理这个迷人的
顾客，章鱼哥先生。

05:42.997 --> 05:44.067
SpongeBob!
海绵宝宝！

05:44.136 --> 05:46.622
We need a Krabby Bucket, pronto!
我们需要一个蟹蟹桶，马上！

05:46.691 --> 05:48.175
- Order up!
- 订购吧！

05:48.244 --> 05:52.559
Love the Dirty Bubble
cosplay, Bubble Bass.
爱肮脏的泡泡
角色扮演，泡泡巴斯。

05:52.628 --> 05:53.939
- [burps]
- [打嗝]

05:54.008 --> 05:55.389
- Oh, yes!
- 哦是的！

05:55.458 --> 05:59.531
This greasy grub is
most invigorating.
这油腻的蛴螬是
最令人振奋。

05:59.600 --> 06:00.601
- Wah!
- 哇！

06:00.670 --> 06:01.982
The real Dirty Bubble?
真正的肮脏泡泡？

06:02.051 --> 06:04.260
- It was a delightful repast.
- 这是一顿令人愉快的晚餐。

06:04.329 --> 06:07.953
But I'm afraid I still
require a refund.
但我恐怕还是
要求退款。

06:08.022 --> 06:09.852
- Me money!
- 我的钱！

06:09.921 --> 06:12.510
- [evil laugh]
- [邪恶的笑声]

06:12.579 --> 06:16.997
- [squeals] Bubble Bass,
get out of me restaurant!
- [尖叫声] 泡泡鲈鱼，
滚出我的餐厅！

06:17.066 --> 06:19.344
But first, give me
me money back.
但首先，给我
还我钱。

06:19.413 --> 06:20.310
[squeals]
[尖叫声]

06:20.380 --> 06:21.277
[growls]
[咆哮]

06:21.346 --> 06:23.693
- Sorry, we won't be leaving...
- 抱歉，我们不会离开...

06:23.762 --> 06:26.593
- Until we're done thieving.
- 直到我们完成偷窃。

06:26.662 --> 06:28.249
- Oh, no!
- 哦，不！

06:28.318 --> 06:31.460
[whimpering]
[呜咽]

06:31.529 --> 06:32.564
Patrick!
帕特里克！

06:32.633 --> 06:34.394
- SpongeBob!
- 海绵宝宝！

06:38.674 --> 06:39.778
- [farts]
- [放屁]

06:39.847 --> 06:41.815
- Hey, I'm trying to eat here!
- 嘿，我想在这里吃饭！

06:41.884 --> 06:44.369
- So is my sidekick.
- 我的搭档也是如此。

06:45.957 --> 06:47.855
Here's another one, partner.
这是另一件事，伙伴。

06:47.924 --> 06:49.236
[chuckles]
[笑声]

06:49.305 --> 06:52.722
- Hey, find your own
patty to suck on!
- 嘿，找到你自己的
帕蒂吸吮！

06:52.791 --> 06:55.967
[splatting, thudding]
[泼溅声、重击声]

06:58.590 --> 06:59.557
[crowd murmuring]
[人群窃窃私语]

06:59.626 --> 07:00.627
- Wait!
- 等待！

07:00.696 --> 07:02.974
Don't go!
别走！

07:04.182 --> 07:06.667
[splatting, thudding]
[泼溅声、重击声]

07:06.736 --> 07:07.737
Quick!
快的！

07:07.806 --> 07:09.118
Get in!
进来！

07:10.844 --> 07:12.190
[panting]
[气喘吁吁]

07:12.259 --> 07:15.020
- Oh, if only Mermaid Man
were here.
- 噢，要是美人鱼男就好了
在这里。

07:15.089 --> 07:18.438
- Heh, I think we can
handle this ourselves.
- 呵呵，我想我们可以
我们自己处理这件事。

07:18.507 --> 07:20.198
[laughs]
[笑]

07:20.267 --> 07:24.374
[triumphant music]
[胜利的音乐]

07:24.444 --> 07:25.652
- Wow!
- 哇！

07:25.721 --> 07:29.587
- Let's go pop that bubble.
- 我们去戳破那个泡泡吧。

07:29.656 --> 07:32.659
- Stop right there,
Dirty Bubble!
- 就停在那里，
肮脏的泡泡！

07:34.902 --> 07:36.628
- What are you supposed to be?
- 你应该是什么？

07:36.697 --> 07:38.906
A Mermaid Man tribute band?
美人鱼人致敬乐队？

07:38.975 --> 07:41.771
- Say hello to Mermaid-Pants.
- 向美人鱼裤问好。

07:41.840 --> 07:43.946
- Captain Tightwad.
- 吝啬鬼船长。

07:44.015 --> 07:45.672
- Dr. Negative.
- 阴性博士。

07:45.741 --> 07:48.675
- And Affordable Car!
- 还有经济实惠的汽车！

07:48.744 --> 07:52.472
- Don't you mean
"Barnacle Star?"
- 你不是说
“藤壶星？”

07:52.541 --> 07:55.267
- What he said.
- 他说什么。

07:55.336 --> 07:56.614
- Ha!
- 哈！

07:56.683 --> 07:58.547
Sea star swipe!
海星横扫！

07:58.616 --> 07:59.927
- Swipe!
- 滑动！

07:59.996 --> 08:03.413
- [blowing]
- [吹气]

08:04.691 --> 08:07.072
- [squeals]
- [尖叫声]

08:07.141 --> 08:08.729
[laughter]
[笑声]

08:08.798 --> 08:10.317
- Feel my penny pinch!
- 感受一下我的手头拮据！

08:10.386 --> 08:13.009
- Pinch!
- 捏！

08:13.078 --> 08:16.979
- Watch the claws, Crabby.
- 小心爪子，暴躁的。

08:17.048 --> 08:19.188
- [squeals]
- [尖叫声]

08:19.257 --> 08:21.328
No, no, no, no!
不，不，不，不！

08:21.397 --> 08:23.157
[wailing]
[哀号]

08:23.226 --> 08:25.297
- Disinfect!
- 消毒！

08:26.782 --> 08:30.889
- Try my negative vibes.
- 试试我的负面情绪。

08:30.958 --> 08:32.408
- Vibes!
- 共鸣！

08:32.477 --> 08:36.792
- Your negativity is
no match for my disdain.
- 你的消极情绪是
敌不过我的蔑视。

08:36.861 --> 08:38.759
- Who cares?
- 谁在乎？

08:38.828 --> 08:40.105
[zap]
[扎普]

08:40.174 --> 08:42.798
- What a bummer.
- 真糟糕。

08:42.867 --> 08:44.524
- Bummer!
- 真糟糕！

08:44.593 --> 08:48.769
- You're our last hope,
Barnacle Star.
- 你是我们最后的希望
藤壶星。

08:48.838 --> 08:51.703
- [straining]
- [紧张]

08:51.772 --> 08:53.878
Sorry, I got nothing.
抱歉，我什么也没得到。

08:53.947 --> 08:55.880
- Nothing!
- 没有什么！

08:55.949 --> 08:58.365
- [evil laugh]
- [邪恶的笑声]

08:58.434 --> 08:59.677
[sloshing]
[晃动]

08:59.746 --> 09:01.506
- Icky!
- 恶心！

09:01.575 --> 09:03.646
[all groaning]
[全都呻吟]

09:03.715 --> 09:04.647
- [squeals]
- [尖叫声]

09:04.716 --> 09:06.235
- [evil laugh]
- [邪恶的笑声]

09:06.304 --> 09:09.238
Now that those counterfeit
clowns are pulverized,
现在那些假货
小丑被碾碎，

09:09.307 --> 09:12.655
what nefarious misdeeds
should we commit next?
有何恶行
接下来我们应该承诺吗？

09:12.724 --> 09:16.970
- [sighs] My filthy powers
are running low, partner.
- [叹气]我肮脏的力量
所剩无几了，伙伴。

09:17.039 --> 09:19.179
I need a recharge.
我需要充电。

09:19.248 --> 09:22.700
- Hm, I know the perfect
place to invigorate
- 嗯，我知道完美的
振奋精神的地方

09:22.769 --> 09:25.841
your noxious batteries.
你的有毒电池。

09:25.910 --> 09:29.430
The Chum Bucket!
密友桶！

09:29.499 --> 09:32.779
Bring out as many buckets
of chum as you can.
拿出尽可能多的桶
尽你所能。

09:32.848 --> 09:36.679
- Show me the money first.
- 先给我看看钱。

09:36.748 --> 09:38.992
- And keep it coming.
- 并继续下去。

09:39.061 --> 09:42.582
- Ooh, why, certainly, sir.
- 哦，当然，先生。

09:45.792 --> 09:48.553
[evil laugh]
[邪恶的笑声]

09:48.622 --> 09:49.589
- Oh.
- 哦。

09:49.658 --> 09:50.797
[slurping]
[发出声音]

09:50.866 --> 09:53.593
Hm, disgustingly delicious.
嗯，好吃得令人作呕。

09:53.662 --> 09:59.115
- The Chum Bucket serves the
foulest fare in Bikini Bottom.
- Chum Bucket 服务于
比基尼堡最肮脏的食物。

09:59.184 --> 10:01.531
- [gulping]
- [吞咽]

10:01.601 --> 10:04.811
Oh, yeah!
哦，是啊！

10:04.880 --> 10:07.607
[chomping]
[咀嚼]

10:08.815 --> 10:11.887
I can feel its
putrid power coursing
我能感觉到它
腐烂的力量流淌

10:11.956 --> 10:14.303
through my bubbly body.
穿过我充满泡沫的身体。

10:14.372 --> 10:16.754
- Many buckets later.
- 很多桶之后。

10:16.823 --> 10:19.860
- [burps]
- [打嗝]

10:19.929 --> 10:22.587
I must have more!
我必须有更多！

10:22.656 --> 10:26.418
- 382, 383...
- 382,​​ 383...
- 382, 383...
- 382，​​ 383...

10:26.487 --> 10:27.419
Huh?
啊？

10:27.488 --> 10:29.732
Ah!
啊!

10:29.801 --> 10:32.908
- Jackpot!
- 大奖！

10:32.977 --> 10:34.979
Or should I say chum-pot?
或者我应该说“笨蛋”？

10:35.048 --> 10:38.120
[evil laugh]
[邪恶的笑声]

10:38.189 --> 10:40.329
- I may have made a slight...
- 我可能做了一点点...

10:40.398 --> 10:43.884
[gulps]
miscalculation.
[吞咽]
误判。

10:43.953 --> 10:46.231
- Wah!
- 哇！

10:46.300 --> 10:49.614
[slurping]
[发出声音]

10:49.683 --> 10:52.306
- [whimpering]
- [呜咽]

10:52.375 --> 10:55.724
- [evil laugh]
- [邪恶的笑声]

10:59.762 --> 11:04.491
This chubby chow has
made me invincible.
这只胖乎乎的松狮有
让我立于不败之地。

11:06.113 --> 11:08.115
Ooh, leftovers.
哦，剩菜了。

11:08.184 --> 11:11.049
[slurps]
[啜饮]

11:11.118 --> 11:14.397
[rumbling]
[隆隆声]

11:14.466 --> 11:15.778
Huh?
啊？

11:15.847 --> 11:19.506
[groaning]
[呻吟]

11:19.575 --> 11:20.749
Uh-oh.
呃哦。

11:24.925 --> 11:26.582
- Ew.
- 呃。

11:26.651 --> 11:29.033
From now on,
I'll stick to villains
从现在开始，
我会坚持恶人

11:29.102 --> 11:31.173
who don't control my life.
谁不能控制我的生活。

11:31.242 --> 11:32.899
- Bubble Bass!
- 泡泡鲈鱼！

11:32.968 --> 11:34.659
- Mother.
- 母亲。

11:34.728 --> 11:38.456
- You come home right this
instant and finish your bath!
- 你就这样回家
立即完成沐浴！

11:38.525 --> 11:40.907
- Right away, Mother.
- 马上，妈妈。

11:42.149 --> 11:45.083
[upbeat music]
[欢快的音乐]

11:45.152 --> 11:51.296
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

11:53.091 --> 11:56.750
- Uh... there!
- 呃...那里！

11:56.819 --> 11:58.407
- Not bad.
- 不错。

11:58.476 --> 12:00.305
But let's see what you
think of this move.
但让我们看看你是什么
想想这个举动。

12:00.374 --> 12:02.238
[phone rings]
Excuse me, Patrick.
[电话铃声]
对不起，帕特里克。

12:02.307 --> 12:04.240
I should get this.
我应该得到这个。

12:04.309 --> 12:07.278
[phone rings]
[电话铃声]

12:07.347 --> 12:09.245
Yello?
耶罗？

12:09.314 --> 12:10.799
- Oh, hello, son.
- 哦，你好，儿子。

12:10.868 --> 12:12.145
Are you busy?
你忙吗？

12:12.214 --> 12:14.768
- Well, Patrick and I
are pretty deep into a game
- 好吧，帕特里克和我
对游戏相当深入

12:14.837 --> 12:17.633
of upside-down checkers,
but I always
颠倒的跳棋，
但我总是

12:17.702 --> 12:20.256
have time for you and Mom.
有时间陪你和妈妈。

12:20.325 --> 12:21.706
Boop.
噗。

12:21.775 --> 12:23.294
- We're very glad to
hear that because
- 我们很高兴
听到这个是因为

12:23.363 --> 12:24.295
we have a surprise for you.
我们为您准备了惊喜。

12:24.364 --> 12:25.434
Boop.
噗。

12:25.503 --> 12:27.263
- A surprise?
- 惊喜？

12:27.332 --> 12:29.024
I love surprises!
我喜欢惊喜！

12:29.093 --> 12:30.853
- Can you come over right away?
- 你能马上过来吗？

12:30.922 --> 12:32.061
- You bet.
- 你打赌。

12:32.130 --> 12:34.236
See you soon.
再见。

12:35.789 --> 12:37.687
Sorry, Patrick, I have to go.
抱歉，帕特里克，我得走了。

12:37.757 --> 12:40.380
But Gary can finish
the game with you.
但加里可以完成
和你一起玩游戏。

12:44.211 --> 12:45.592
- Meow.
- 喵。

12:45.661 --> 12:48.871
- Looks like I only
have one move left.
- 看来只有我
还剩一招。

12:51.563 --> 12:54.912
[bright music]
[明亮的音乐]

12:56.085 --> 12:57.190
- Hi, Mom!
- 嗨，妈妈！

12:57.259 --> 12:58.329
Hi, Dad!
嗨，爸爸！

12:58.398 --> 12:59.917
- Hello, darling.
Oh.
- 你好，亲爱的。
哦。

12:59.986 --> 13:01.332
[giggles]
[咯咯笑]

13:03.610 --> 13:06.440
- My surprise has to be
around here somewhere!
- 我的惊喜一定是
就在这附近的某个地方！

13:06.509 --> 13:08.546
- It sure is, Son.
- 确实如此，儿子。

13:08.615 --> 13:10.237
Are you ready for it?
你准备好了吗？

13:10.306 --> 13:11.342
- Where is it?
- 它在哪里？

13:11.411 --> 13:13.378
Where is it?
Where is it?
它在哪里？
它在哪里？

13:13.447 --> 13:16.830
- Well, you're standing on it.
- 好吧，你就站在上面。

13:16.899 --> 13:19.039
- [groans]
- [呻吟]

13:19.108 --> 13:20.075
Boop.
噗。

13:20.144 --> 13:21.421
- Plankton?
- 浮游生物？

13:21.490 --> 13:24.113
- Meet your new
brother, Sheldon.
- 认识你的新人
兄弟，谢尔顿。

13:24.182 --> 13:28.946
- [evil laugh]
- [邪恶的笑声]

13:29.015 --> 13:30.292
[baby giggles]
[宝宝咯咯笑]

13:30.361 --> 13:33.019
- He-he.
- 呵呵。

13:33.088 --> 13:34.606
[doorbell chimes]
[门铃响]

13:34.675 --> 13:36.781
- We found him on our
doorstep this morning.
- 我们在我们的
今天早上家门口。

13:36.850 --> 13:39.611
- He was just as
cute as a button.
- 他就像
像按钮一样可爱。

13:42.580 --> 13:45.963
- And we did what any
decent sponges would do
- 我们做了任何事
合适的海绵就可以了

13:46.032 --> 13:49.380
and immediately adopted
the little foundling.
并立即采纳
小弃儿。

13:49.449 --> 13:52.176
- Heh, heh, heh, heh.
- 呵呵，呵呵，呵呵。

13:52.245 --> 13:53.246
[splutters]
[杂音]

13:53.315 --> 13:55.455
I'm your new brother!
我是你的新兄弟！

13:55.524 --> 13:57.250
- Wait a minute.
- 等一下。

13:57.319 --> 13:58.838
- [nervous laughs]
- [紧张的笑声]

13:58.907 --> 14:01.495
- This is... great!
- 这……太棒了！

14:01.564 --> 14:03.946
I've always wanted a brother!
我一直想要一个哥哥！

14:04.015 --> 14:05.016
Ooh!
哦！

14:05.085 --> 14:07.950
- All right,
you two boys have fun.
- 好吧，
你们两个男孩玩得很开心。

14:08.019 --> 14:10.573
[smooching]
[接吻]

14:10.642 --> 14:12.196
- All right, SpongeBob.
- 好吧，海绵宝宝。

14:12.265 --> 14:13.680
You heard the dopes.
你听到了毒品。

14:13.749 --> 14:16.510
Eh, I mean,
"Mommy" and "Daddy."
呃，我的意思是，
“妈妈”和“爸爸”。

14:16.579 --> 14:17.960
We're brothers now.
我们现在是兄弟了。

14:18.029 --> 14:20.963
And brothers tell
each other everything.
还有兄弟们告诉
彼此的一切。

14:21.032 --> 14:22.482
[evil laugh]
[邪恶的笑声]

14:22.551 --> 14:25.002
Especially the Krabby Patty
secret formula.
尤其是蟹肉饼
秘密配方。

14:25.071 --> 14:26.279
[evil laugh]
[邪恶的笑声]

14:26.348 --> 14:29.454
[laughter]
[笑声]

14:29.523 --> 14:30.800
- You're right, Plankton.
- 你说得对，浮游生物。

14:30.870 --> 14:33.355
There's no secrets
between brothers.
没有秘密
兄弟之间。

14:33.424 --> 14:34.735
- Yes.
- 是的。

14:34.804 --> 14:36.116
Yes!
是的！

14:36.185 --> 14:39.326
- But first, we have to
get closer by doing things
- 但首先我们必须
通过做事来拉近距离

14:39.395 --> 14:42.122
together, like brothers do.
在一起，就像兄弟一样。

14:42.191 --> 14:46.402
- [sighs] Eh, fine.
- [叹气] 呃，好吧。

14:46.471 --> 14:48.818
- First up,
a little game of catch.
- 首先，
一个接球的小游戏。

14:48.888 --> 14:52.857
- Hold on, hold on!
This glove is too big.
- 坚持住，坚持住！
这手套太大了。

14:52.926 --> 14:54.548
- Heads up!
- 小心！

14:54.617 --> 14:56.757
- [groans] Here.
- [呻吟]这里。

14:56.826 --> 14:59.450
Here you go.
[grunts]
干得好。
[咕哝]

14:59.519 --> 15:01.245
- Nice throw, Plankton.
- 投得漂亮，浮游生物。

15:01.314 --> 15:04.558
Now here comes one with
a little spice on it.
现在来了一个
上面加一点香料。

15:04.627 --> 15:07.044
- No, wait!
- 不，等等！

15:07.113 --> 15:09.909
[sizzling]
[嘶嘶声]

15:09.978 --> 15:12.532
It burns!
它燃烧了！

15:13.982 --> 15:16.053
[splat]
[啪嗒]

15:16.122 --> 15:20.643
- Oh, Harold, it's so nice to
see our boys getting along.
- 哦，哈罗德，真是太好了
看看我们的孩子们相处得怎么样。

15:20.712 --> 15:23.819
- Aw, it really is, dear.
- 噢，确实如此，亲爱的。

15:23.888 --> 15:25.062
[splat]
[啪嗒]

15:25.131 --> 15:26.926
- [groans]
- [呻吟]

15:26.995 --> 15:29.790
OK, enough catch.
好吧，够了。

15:31.827 --> 15:34.347
How about we share secrets now?
我们现在分享秘密怎么样？

15:34.416 --> 15:39.179
- Sorry, but we haven't filled
our brotherly love meter yet.
- 抱歉，我们还没有填写
我们的兄弟情米还没到。

15:39.248 --> 15:40.974
We have more bonding to do.
我们还有更多的联系要做。

15:41.043 --> 15:43.494
And what better way
to brotherly bond
还有什么更好的方法
兄弟情谊

15:43.563 --> 15:46.428
than by helping our neighbors?
而不是帮助我们的邻居？

15:46.497 --> 15:48.948
- [groans]
- [呻吟]

15:50.880 --> 15:52.675
- I'm sure these
nice ladies will
- 我确定这些
好女士们会

15:52.744 --> 15:54.608
have some chores for us to do.
有一些家务事要我们做。

15:54.677 --> 15:56.127
- Oh, goody.
- 哦，太好了。

15:56.196 --> 15:57.887
[doorbell rings]
[门铃响]

15:57.957 --> 16:01.167
- Whatever you're selling,
I'm not buying.
- 无论你卖什么，
我不买。

16:01.236 --> 16:02.823
- No, ma'am.
- 不，女士。

16:02.892 --> 16:04.239
My brother and I were hoping
you had some housework
我和我的兄弟都希望
你有一些家务活

16:04.308 --> 16:05.688
that needs doing.
那需要做。

16:05.757 --> 16:07.759
- You two look like
a couple of weirdos.
- 你们两个看起来像
几个怪人。

16:07.828 --> 16:10.831
And I don't let
weirdos touch my stuff!
我不让
怪人碰我的东西！

16:10.900 --> 16:11.660
- Ma!
- 妈！

16:11.729 --> 16:13.282
Give it a rest!
让它休息一下吧！

16:13.351 --> 16:14.421
Don't mind her.
别理她。

16:14.490 --> 16:16.527
You boys can mow our kelp lawn.
你们可以修剪我们的海带草坪。

16:18.529 --> 16:20.496
Mower's out by the tires.
割草机的轮胎坏了。

16:20.565 --> 16:21.635
Careful.
小心。

16:21.704 --> 16:24.086
- We're always careful, ma'am.
- 我们总是很小心，女士。

16:24.155 --> 16:27.365
OK, little brother,
you get the motor going.
好吧，小兄弟，
你让马达运转起来。

16:27.434 --> 16:30.265
And I'll drive.
我会开车。

16:30.334 --> 16:32.543
- [grunting]
- [咕哝]

16:32.612 --> 16:34.890
Hey, can we switch places?
嘿，我们可以换个地方吗？

16:34.959 --> 16:36.029
- [laughs]
- [笑]

16:36.098 --> 16:38.204
That's cute,
but you're not tall enough
真可爱，
但你不够高

16:38.273 --> 16:39.446
to work the controls.
来操作控件。

16:39.515 --> 16:41.172
Now give her a good tug.
现在用力地拉她一下。

16:41.241 --> 16:43.554
- All right, whatever.
- 好吧，无论如何。

16:43.623 --> 16:47.489
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

16:50.043 --> 16:53.184
[straining]
[紧张]

16:53.253 --> 16:56.222
[engine whirring]
[引擎的呼呼声]

16:56.291 --> 16:59.639
[screaming]
[尖叫]

17:04.471 --> 17:05.748
- Are you OK?
- 你还好吗？

17:05.817 --> 17:08.234
You were supposed to be careful.
你应该小心点。

17:10.270 --> 17:12.548
- Mmm.
- 嗯。

17:12.617 --> 17:15.413
Nice work, I think.
干得好，我想。

17:15.482 --> 17:16.863
Here's a shiny nickel, boys.
孩子们，这是一枚闪亮的镍币。

17:16.932 --> 17:19.521
- You're paying for this mess?
- 你要为这个烂摊子买单吗？

17:19.590 --> 17:21.316
Quit spoiling them, Mary.
别再宠坏他们了，玛丽。

17:21.385 --> 17:22.386
[coin clinks]
[硬币叮当响]

17:22.455 --> 17:24.353
- A lousy nickel?
- 一枚糟糕的镍币？

17:24.422 --> 17:26.424
Why, you decrepit...
[grunts]
怎么，你衰弱了……
[咕哝]

17:26.493 --> 17:29.324
- We're rich.
- 我们很有钱。

17:29.393 --> 17:31.809
OK, next, we're going to
head down to the junkyard
好的，接下来我们要
前往垃圾场

17:31.878 --> 17:33.397
and play with the
metal shredder.
并与
金属粉碎机。

17:33.466 --> 17:34.915
- No way!
- 决不！

17:34.984 --> 17:36.952
I've had it with your
torturous activities.
我已经和你受够了
折磨人的活动。

17:37.021 --> 17:39.644
[horns honking]
I'm... wait a second.
[喇叭鸣响]
我……等一下。

17:39.713 --> 17:40.818
Where are we?
我们在哪里？

17:40.887 --> 17:42.958
Right by the Clown College.
就在小丑学院旁边。

17:43.027 --> 17:44.718
Why?
为什么？

17:44.787 --> 17:46.893
- We have to get out
of here right now.
- 我们必须出去
现在就在这里。

17:46.962 --> 17:47.790
Come on!
快点！

17:47.859 --> 17:49.171
We'll take the long way home.
我们要走很远的路回家。

17:49.240 --> 17:50.586
- What's the matter?
- 怎么了？

17:50.655 --> 17:52.416
You're not afraid
of clowns, are you?
你不害怕
小丑，你是吗？

17:52.485 --> 17:54.556
[giggling]
[咯咯笑]

17:54.625 --> 17:57.628
- [growling]
- [咆哮]

18:01.287 --> 18:05.463
I thought I told you not to
come around here, Shrimp!
我以为我告诉过你不要
到这里来吧，虾！

18:05.532 --> 18:08.570
- [nervously laughs]
Yeah, you might have mentioned
- [紧张地笑]
是的，你可能已经提到过

18:08.639 --> 18:10.468
that before, Squeakers.
之前的事，吱吱声。

18:10.537 --> 18:13.264
- That's Mr. Squeakers to you.
- 对你而言，这就是吱吱先生。

18:13.333 --> 18:19.270
Looks like my big shoes get
to stomp a tiny punk today.
看起来我的大鞋得到了
今天去踩一个小混混。

18:19.339 --> 18:21.721
- [whimpering]
- [呜咽]

18:21.790 --> 18:24.068
- Brother!
- 兄弟！

18:24.137 --> 18:25.759
No!
不！

18:25.828 --> 18:28.521
[heroic music]
[英雄音乐]

18:28.590 --> 18:31.731
- Wah!
- 哇！

18:33.974 --> 18:38.393
- You... you saved me from
that big-footed buffoon.
- 你...你救了我
那个大脚小丑。

18:38.462 --> 18:39.739
- Of course.
- 当然。

18:39.808 --> 18:41.016
Brothers stick up
for each other.
兄弟们挺身而出
为了彼此。

18:41.085 --> 18:42.845
- I can't believe
I'm saying this,
- 我不敢相信
我说的是这个

18:42.914 --> 18:45.883
but, uh, I think
I want to do more
但是，呃，我想
我想做更多

18:45.952 --> 18:49.714
stuff with you, big brother.
跟你有事，大哥。

18:49.783 --> 18:52.821
[cheerful music]
[欢快的音乐]

18:52.890 --> 19:00.035
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

19:14.636 --> 19:21.781
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

19:25.474 --> 19:28.236
- That cloud looks
like an elephant fish.
- 那朵云看起来
像象鱼一样。

19:28.305 --> 19:31.066
- That one looks
like an iron maiden.
- 那个看起来
像铁娘子一样。

19:31.135 --> 19:34.449
- That one looks like
a baby jellyfish.
- 那个看起来像
一只小水母。

19:34.518 --> 19:38.038
- Ooh, that one looks
like a depth charge.
- 哦，那个看起来
就像深水炸弹一样。

19:38.107 --> 19:42.388
Thank you, SpongeBob,
for a truly wonderful day.
谢谢你，海绵宝宝，
度过真正美好的一天。

19:42.457 --> 19:44.838
I had a lot of brothers
and sisters growing up,
我有很多兄弟
和成长中的姐妹们，

19:44.907 --> 19:48.808
but never one who was
actually nice to me.
但从来没有一个人
其实对我很好。

19:48.877 --> 19:51.397
- Little brother, I'm ready.
- 小兄弟，我准备好了。

19:51.466 --> 19:53.088
- Ready?
Ready for what?
- 准备好？
准备好做什么？

19:53.157 --> 19:55.987
- We're real brothers now.
- 我们现在是真正的兄弟了。

19:56.056 --> 19:59.991
I'm ready to share my deepest,
most secretest secret.
我已经准备好分享我最深的
最秘密的秘密。

20:00.060 --> 20:02.684
I swore I'd never
tell it to anyone.
我发誓我永远不会
告诉任何人。

20:02.753 --> 20:04.582
Oh, but I'm nervous.
哦，但是我很紧张。

20:04.651 --> 20:05.825
Could you go first?
你可以先走吗？

20:05.894 --> 20:07.413
- Of course.
- 当然。

20:07.482 --> 20:09.415
Anything for my brother.
为了我的兄弟，什么都可以做。

20:09.484 --> 20:10.864
Eh.
呃。

20:10.933 --> 20:13.419
I put on a gruff
exterior because I don't
我装出一副粗暴的样子
外部因为我不

20:13.488 --> 20:15.628
want the world to hurt me.
想要全世界都伤害我。

20:15.697 --> 20:17.837
But deep down,
I'm afraid I'll push
但内心深处，
我怕我会推

20:17.906 --> 20:21.392
everyone away and end up alone.
每个人都离开了，最后只剩下孤独一人。

20:21.461 --> 20:25.396
[sad violin music]
[悲伤的小提琴音乐]

20:26.328 --> 20:29.607
- Well, thanks very much for
sharing that, little brother.
- 嗯，非常感谢
分享一下，小兄弟。

20:29.676 --> 20:32.161
Now it's my turn.
现在轮到我了。

20:32.231 --> 20:35.406
[inhales deeply]
[深吸一口气]

20:35.475 --> 20:38.789
No one is supposed
to know this, but...
没有人应该
要知道这一点，但是...

20:38.858 --> 20:39.790
but...
但...

20:39.859 --> 20:41.585
- Yes?
- 是的？

20:41.654 --> 20:43.380
Yes?
是的？

20:43.449 --> 20:46.210
- My tie, it's...
- 我的领带，它是...

20:46.279 --> 20:47.901
a clip-on!
一个夹子！

20:47.970 --> 20:49.524
- I knew it!
- 我就知道！

20:49.593 --> 20:50.904
Wait, what?
等等，什么？

20:50.973 --> 20:54.218
- I never learned
how to tie a tie!
-我没学过
如何打领带！

20:54.287 --> 20:57.290
Look at it!
Look at it!
看看它！
看看它！

20:57.359 --> 21:01.846
Look your eyes upon
my accursed shame!
看着你的眼睛
我该死的耻辱！

21:01.915 --> 21:05.885
[breathing raggedly]
[呼吸急促]

21:05.954 --> 21:09.164
Whew, sure felt good to
get that off my chest.
哇，确实感觉很好
把这件事从我心里说出来。

21:09.233 --> 21:11.373
- That's it?
- 就是这样？

21:11.442 --> 21:13.306
That's your secret?
这就是你的秘密？

21:13.375 --> 21:14.618
Are you kidding me?
你在开玩笑吧？

21:14.687 --> 21:17.931
- Yep, that was it.
- 是的，就是这样。

21:18.000 --> 21:19.830
Wait, are you upset?
等等，你不高兴吗？

21:19.899 --> 21:22.004
- You're darn right I am!
- 你说得对，我就是！

21:22.073 --> 21:24.835
You were supposed to tell me
the secret formula!
你应该告诉我
秘密配方！

21:24.904 --> 21:27.424
Nobody cares about your tie!
没人关心你的领带！

21:27.493 --> 21:29.184
- The secret formula?
- 秘密配方？

21:29.253 --> 21:31.117
That's what you wanted to hear?
这就是你想听的？

21:31.186 --> 21:32.808
Oh, I can't share that.
哦，我不能分享这个。

21:32.877 --> 21:34.672
It's locked in my brain box.
它被锁在我的大脑盒子里。

21:34.741 --> 21:36.329
[beeping]
[嘟嘟声]

21:36.398 --> 21:38.538
- [snoring]
- [打鼾]

21:38.607 --> 21:43.474
- Well, then, I'll use
this key to unlock it.
- 那么，我就用
这把钥匙可以解锁它。

21:43.543 --> 21:44.717
[whirring]
[呼呼]

21:44.786 --> 21:46.477
- [shrieks]
- [尖叫]

21:46.546 --> 21:48.341
- [laughs]
- [笑]

21:48.410 --> 21:51.171
- Oh, boy, I was afraid of this.
- 哦，天哪，我很害怕这个。

21:51.240 --> 21:55.590
- It looks like you two just
weren't made to be brothers.
- 看起来你们两个刚刚
本来就不是兄弟。

21:55.659 --> 21:57.523
Such a shame.
太可惜了。

21:57.592 --> 21:59.732
- Hey, what are you doing?
- 嘿，你在做什么？

21:59.801 --> 22:03.529
- Well, the only thing
responsible parents can do...
- 好吧，唯一的事情
负责任的父母可以做...

22:03.598 --> 22:07.222
making our child
someone else's problem.
使我们的孩子
别人的问题。

22:07.291 --> 22:08.499
- Bye, Plankton.
- 再见，浮游生物。

22:08.568 --> 22:11.088
I really liked having
you as a brother.
我真的很喜欢
作为兄弟的你。

22:11.157 --> 22:15.368
- Yeah, well,
I hated every minute...
- 是啊，好吧，
我讨厌每一分钟...

22:15.437 --> 22:17.508
[doorbell rings]
[门铃响]

22:17.577 --> 22:18.751
- Why, look, Cecil!
- 为什么，看，塞西尔！

22:18.820 --> 22:20.787
It's a baby boy!
这是一个男婴！

22:20.856 --> 22:22.306
- Fantastic!
- 极好的！

22:22.375 --> 22:25.274
I've always wanted our
son to have a brother.
我一直想要我们的
儿子有一个兄弟。

22:25.344 --> 22:27.380
Oh, Patrick!
哦，帕特里克！

22:29.348 --> 22:30.625
- All right!
- 好的！

22:30.694 --> 22:33.662
Let's play checkers!
我们来玩跳棋吧！

22:33.731 --> 22:36.734
Checkers! Checkers! Checkers!
- Ouch! Ow!
跳棋！跳棋！跳棋！
- 哎呀！噢！

22:36.803 --> 22:38.633
- [giggles]
- [咯咯笑]

22:38.702 --> 22:40.876
- Oh, brother.
- 哦，兄弟。

- 哦，兄弟。